{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vuwLA6YykT1793597640.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平與到訪的阿曼蘇丹海賽姆，舉行會談。</p><p></p><p>習近平在北京人民大會堂，為海賽姆舉行歡迎儀式。二人隨後會談，並共同出席合作文件簽字儀式。習近平指，準備好與海賽姆引領中阿戰略夥伴關係提升到更高水平、更好服務兩國人民，為地區和平、穩定及繁榮作出貢獻。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.OMAN-1300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260v5WOIaUx61793597630.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>海賽姆周日晚上抵達北京展開兩日國事訪問。今次是兩國建交48年來，阿曼元首首度訪華。國務院總理李強亦將會見海賽姆。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:21:15.755251+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:38:55.414433+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T06:18:26.721415+00:00","content_hash":"fd54788a96ce82f4a0bb1a17db95aaeb96d40106f2e2529ad6919c42ff205a4e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:21:15.755251+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}